  (descr "KNX bus connection: 2 x 1.0 mm solder pins (WAGO 243-131, LCSC C20252226; or Mill-Max 3103-2-00-80-00-00-08-0 / Harwin H2173-01 / Ettinger 013.14.125) at 5.75 mm pitch for the WAGO 243-211 red/grey KNX plug. Pad 1 = KNX+ (red half, dovetail tongue end), pad 2 = KNX- (grey). Plug body 11.5 (+1.0 tongue) x 10 x 10 mm high; wire-entry face toward +Y, 6.6 mm from the pins. Leave >= 10 mm for wires in front of it or let it overhang the board edge. Drawing: WAGO 243-211 datasheet; onsemi EVBUM2338 (J4, Ettinger 13.14.125).")
